{% column %}
This topic helps you participate in your community. To participate means to go out of your house. It also means doing activities with other people.

To participate is also about making your own decisions. You can choose what you like and what interests you.

Artificial Intelligence helps you if you learn to use it. It is easy to use if you learn in a simple way. In this topic, you will learn to use technology easily.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

Artificial Intelligence helps you connect with other people:

●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; It helps you make decisions: Artificial Intelligence gives you ideas to make your own plans.

●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; It helps you plan your free time: Artificial Intelligence gives you leisure ideas based on your tastes.

●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; It helps you find accessible events: You can look for concerts, football matches, or parties in your city that are easy to enjoy.

●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; It helps you make new friends: You can find people who have the same interests as you.

Learn to use technology in a simple way to enjoy your community!
